exists (see the PRD), re-run it against `plugins/development-harness/skills/multi-perspective-review/SKILL.md` and `plugins/development-harness/agents/review-synthesizer.md` to regenerate G4 (and L0/L1 for the new forks), then run `uv run plugins/development-harness/docs/assemble_graph.py` to rebuild `dh-workflow-graph.json`.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: PR #3207 review thread (chatgpt-codex-connector), addressed during rebase on 2026-08-24\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-24\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"585290f2d45e8d1c421a3566dd48cf76d9eab0440a6050e21a486c5cf212406f\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABQg4WCQ\"}"}